:: Business Relations [event mom_quest] {"position":"3275,1075","size":"100,100"}
<<silent>><<SetBackground "images/locations/reception.jpg">><</silent>>
I walk into the lobby with a thick envelope in the inside pocket of my jacket, and I'm very aware of it the whole time, like it might start glowing. The receptionist barely looks up.

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: "Receptionist", text: "Floor 6? I'd say give her my best, but... well. You probably heard." },
{ who: $player, text: "Yeah, I heard." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

<<linkreplace "Take the elevator up">>
<<silently>><<SetBackground "images/locations/elevator.jpg">><</silently>>
The elevator mirror shows me a guy in his only decent jacket, trying to look like he does this kind of thing all the time.

<<linkreplace "Arrive at floor 6...">>
<<silently>><<SetBackground $locations[12].img>><</silently>>
The doors open on the usual noise. Somebody has already moved a potted plant onto $mom.callName's old desk, and her chair is pushed in neatly, like she just went to lunch. Her nameplate is gone.

I walk straight past it to the corner office. The prototype is on in my pocket, set to the same spot that worked last time. <<UseQuestDevice $mom>>I knock once and go in. He's leaning back in his chair with his hands folded on his stomach, like he's been expecting a pizza.
<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $boss, text: "Right on time, kid. I had a feeling you'd show up today. You bring my stuff?" },
{ who: $player, text: "The five thousand and the video, like we said." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

<<linkreplace "Deliver the payment and video">>
I put the envelope on his desk. He doesn't count it, which somehow feels more insulting than if he had. Then I pull out my phone, open the clip of $mom.callName in her bed, and slide it across to him.

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $boss, text: "Well, would you look at that. Nice and clear, too. You really came through, kid." },
{ text: "He watches it to the end, then plays it again before he hands the phone back. I wipe the screen on my jeans." },
{ who: $player, text: "There's one more thing I wanted to ask you. I'd like you as a client. You've seen what $company.prototype.name did on your floor out there." },
{ who: $boss, text: "A client. Of your little gadget company. Do you even have any other customers?" },
{ who: $player, text: "One. A diner, ten minutes from here. Sales went up the first day it ran." },
{ who: $boss, text: "A diner. Wow. Stop, you're making me nervous." },
{ who: $player, text: "You saw how calm she was out there these last few weeks, though. That wasn't yoga." },
{ text: "He opens his mouth, closes it again, and then laughs, a short bark that makes the window behind him rattle." },
{ who: $boss, text: "Fair enough, it did something, I'll give you that. Okay, kid, one condition. Your $mom.relation runs the account. She's the one who comes here and the one who reports to me, every step of the way, in person." },
{ who: $player, text: "She already works for me, so she'll be your project manager. You'll see plenty of her." },
{ who: $boss, text: "Then we've got a deal. Send me the contract, and tell $mom.name I said welcome back." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

<<linkreplace "Leave the office">>
<<silently>><<SetBackground "images/locations/elevator.jpg">><</silently>>
He's already turning back to his screen when I close the door behind me. On the way to the elevator I walk past her old desk again. Someone has put a coffee mug on it.

Two clients now. One of them is a diner whose manager still thinks of me as the guy who mops the floors, and the other is the man who fired my $mom.relation this week, for reasons she'll never know. And right in the middle of both, smiling and taking notes and trying her best, there's going to be $mom.callName.

I press the button for the lobby, and it takes me a few floors to notice I'm whistling.
<<UpdateStat "+" "Corruption" 5>>
<<UpdateStat "+" "MomCorruption" 4>>
<<ProfileLog $mom "Project Manager" "She's now the project manager between my company and her old boss, my second client. He wants her in close contact every step of the way.">>
<<NextQuest $mom>>
<<UpdateStat "-" "Money" "5000">>

<<ReturnFromEvent>>
<</linkreplace>>
<</linkreplace>>
<</linkreplace>>
<</linkreplace>>
